Lojban-internal name for ((cmavo)) of ((selma'o)) BAI, and also ((PU)), ((ZAhO)), etc. Anything that can tag a ((sumti)).

The full list is:

# ((fi'o)) + ((selbri))
# ((BAI))
# ((CAhA))
# ((KI))
# ((CUhE)) (i.e. ((cu'e)) and ((nau)))
# ((ZI))
# ((ZEhA))
# ((PU))
# ((VA))
# ((FAhA)) and ((MOhI)) + ((FAhA))
# ((VEhA))
# ((VIhA))
# ((PA)) + ((ROI))
# ((TAhE)) (plus ((fe'e)))
# ((ZAhO)) (plus ((fe'e)))

Plus combinations of them.

((tanru versus lujvo rant)) argues that ''sumtcita'' is a better term.
